{"id":"6b3f52af2d45c0ea","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-collapsing-closure.md","title":"Veblen Closure Stages for Collapsing","display":"df-collapsing-closure — Veblen Closure Stages for Collapsing","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-collapsing-closure","aliases":["18-df-collapsing-closure","18-df-057"],"display":"df-collapsing-closure — Veblen Closure Stages for Collapsing","depends_on":["[[18-df-ordinal]]","[[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]]"],"source_work":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)","source_section":"§9.4 Definition 9.4.1; §9.6 clauses (B0)–(B3), (9.29)","source_printed_pages":"173; 182–183","source_pdf_pages":"183; 192–193","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_review":"未逐项复核原书证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-collapsing-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-collapsing-closure</span><span>18-df-057</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-collapsing-closure — Veblen Closure Stages for Collapsing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"40176d5c80238174\" href=\"?note=40176d5c80238174\" title=\"18-df-veblen-hierarchy\">18-df-veblen-hierarchy</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_work","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§9.4 Definition 9.4.1; §9.6 clauses (B0)–(B3), (9.29)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"173; 182–183"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"183; 192–193"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_review","html":"未逐项复核原书证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>在 ZFC 元理论中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega=\\omega_1\">\\(\\Omega=\\omega_1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_\\beta(\\gamma)\">\\(\\varphi_\\beta(\\gamma)\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"40176d5c80238174\" href=\"?note=40176d5c80238174\" title=\"18-df-veblen-hierarchy\">18-df-veblen-hierarchy</a> 的 Veblen 类函数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_\\alpha^n\">\\(C_\\alpha^n\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(\\alpha)\">\\(C(\\alpha)\\)</span> 是下式与本节点的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> 同时作超限递归引入的集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\\upharpoonright\\alpha\">\\(\\psi\\upharpoonright\\alpha\\)</span> 只涉及严格较小的序数参数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_\\alpha^0:=\\{0,\\Omega\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_\\alpha^0:=\\{0,\\Omega\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nC_\\alpha^{n+1}:={}&amp;C_\\alpha^n\n\\cup\\{\\beta+\\gamma\\mid\\beta,\\gamma\\in C_\\alpha^n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\varphi_\\beta(\\gamma)\\mid\\beta,\\gamma\\in C_\\alpha^n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\psi(\\xi)\\mid\\xi\\in C_\\alpha^n\\cap\\alpha\\},\\\\\nC(\\alpha):={}&amp;\\bigcup_{n&lt;\\omega}C_\\alpha^n,\\\\\n\\psi(\\alpha):={}&amp;\\min\\bigl(\\Omega\\setminus C(\\alpha)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nC_\\alpha^{n+1}:={}&amp;C_\\alpha^n\n\\cup\\{\\beta+\\gamma\\mid\\beta,\\gamma\\in C_\\alpha^n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\varphi_\\beta(\\gamma)\\mid\\beta,\\gamma\\in C_\\alpha^n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\psi(\\xi)\\mid\\xi\\in C_\\alpha^n\\cap\\alpha\\},\\\\\nC(\\alpha):={}&amp;\\bigcup_{n&lt;\\omega}C_\\alpha^n,\\\\\n\\psi(\\alpha):={}&amp;\\min\\bigl(\\Omega\\setminus C(\\alpha)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(\\alpha)\">\\(C(\\alpha)\\)</span> 对应原书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_\\alpha=B_\\alpha(\\varnothing)\">\\(B_\\alpha=B_\\alpha(\\varnothing)\\)</span>。原书 §9.6 的 (B0)–(B3) 使用强临界成分闭包；p.183 明确说明它等价于从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,\\Omega\\}\">\\(\\{0,\\Omega\\}\\)</span> 开始对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\">\\(+\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 和受限的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\\upharpoonright\\alpha\">\\(\\psi\\upharpoonright\\alpha\\)</span> 封闭。上述有限阶段使用这一等价展开。</p>\n<p>旧稿遗漏 Veblen 运算，并把所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi&lt;\\alpha\">\\(\\xi&lt;\\alpha\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi(\\xi)\">\\(\\psi(\\xi)\\)</span> 直接放进初始阶段；这会改变崩塌函数。修订保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的本地记号，恢复原书必须满足的条件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi\\in C(\\alpha)\\cap\\alpha\">\\(\\xi\\in C(\\alpha)\\cap\\alpha\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>递归按外层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>、内层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 进行。每阶段与可数并均可数，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(\\alpha)\">\\(C(\\alpha)\\)</span> 不覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>；这同时保证本节点中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi(\\alpha)\">\\(\\psi(\\alpha)\\)</span> 的最小值存在。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-veblen-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"40176d5c80238174","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-veblen-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"40176d5c80238174","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"在 ZFC 元理论中，$\\Omega=\\omega_1$；$\\varphi_\\beta(\\gamma)$ 为 [[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]] 的 Veblen 类函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega=\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_\\beta(\\gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"C_\\alpha^n","display":false},{"tex":"C(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi\\upharpoonright\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"C_\\alpha^0:=\\{0,\\Omega\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nC_\\alpha^{n+1}:={}&C_\\alpha^n\n\\cup\\{\\beta+\\gamma\\mid\\beta,\\gamma\\in C_\\alpha^n\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\varphi_\\beta(\\gamma)\\mid\\beta,\\gamma\\in C_\\alpha^n\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\psi(\\xi)\\mid\\xi\\in C_\\alpha^n\\cap\\alpha\\},\\\\\nC(\\alpha):={}&\\bigcup_{n<\\omega}C_\\alpha^n,\\\\\n\\psi(\\alpha):={}&\\min\\bigl(\\Omega\\setminus C(\\alpha)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"C(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"B_\\alpha=B_\\alpha(\\varnothing)","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,\\Omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"+","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi\\upharpoonright\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\xi<\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi(\\xi)","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\xi\\in C(\\alpha)\\cap\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"C(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi(\\alpha)","display":false}],"bytes":2216,"backlinks":[{"id":"d042b39a8b79bc06","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$C(\\alpha)$ 由 [[18-df-collapsing-closure]] 定义。$\\psi$ 是同一节点同时递归引入的可定义类函数 $\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\Omega$，不是预先假定的集合函数。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-118","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-collapsing-closure]]"},{"id":"1c1dcb6d897f9b41","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$C$、$\\psi$ 为 [[18-df-collapsing-closure]]、[[18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function]] 中同时递归定义的类函数。"},{"id":"50076d54977c5fd6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$C$、$\\psi$ 为 [[18-df-collapsing-closure]]、[[18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function]] 中同时递归定义的类函数。"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-62","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-collapsing-closure]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-collapsing-closure]]"}],"outgoing":["cf95026e035bcb2b","40176d5c80238174"]}